n.io` for bootstrap and `https://rpc.mainnet.miden.io` for sync.\n\nFull-node startup requires exactly one of `--network` or `--sync.block-source.url`; an upstream URL supplied through `MIDEN_NODE_SYNC_BLOCK_SOURCE_URL` also conflicts with `--network`. Existing custom upstream URLs remain supported. `make format` and 13 targeted CLI and genesis tests passed; the broader test run was blocked by sandbox restrictions on localhost access.\n\n## Changelog\n\n```toml\n[[entry]]\nscope       = \"node\"\nimpact      = \"added\"\ndescription = \"Support mainnet bootstrap and network selection for full-node sync with --network.\"\n\n[[entry]]\nscope       = \"ntx-builder\"\nimpact      = \"added\"\ndescription = \"Support mainnet bootstrap with --network mainnet.\"\n```\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T07:52:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T08:07:56Z","closed_at":"2026-10-07T08:07:54Z","merged_at":"2026-10-07T08:07:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"c152ca515c50e9e4a94330db1554b5a899a7f362","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kkovaacs","id":629536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTUzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/629536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs","html_url":"https://github.com/kkovaacs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkovaacs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"dr